Spec: Isolated installed trial acceptance

Purpose:
  Verify the delivered package through one owned install, explicit configuration and independent SDK application transfer.

Owns:
  ./verify-trial.py

Must:
  Use the built installer and packaged executables, a temporary WSL Linux authenticated server and independently launched application processes.
  Keep server private keys on Linux and exercise explicit server and local owner commands rather than injecting authorization records.
  Bound subprocess waits and payload sizes; stop only processes created by this run and uninstall only its isolated directory.
  Preserve user identities and existing installed services; freeze aggregate evidence without keys, addresses or runtime tokens.
  Report LAN direct and forced relay separately without claiming physical mobile or cross-NAT acceptance.
